        <Dialogs>
          <Dialog>？？？</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Wooooooo......
Oooooooo......</Dialog>
          <Dialog>○○○○○○○○</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Mmm......</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Heeheeheehee......
Wake uuuup...
You must wake uuuup...</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Hm？
...▲小早川＊▲？</Dialog>
          <Dialog>………………。</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Kobayakawa</Dialog>
          <Dialog>What are you doing？</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Telling ghost stories, duh.
What are you doing sleeping？</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Hold on, wait...
The candles, the uniform...
Where do I even start...？</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Forget the details.
It's a school trip classic, right？
And we haven't done it yet.</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Well, now that you mention it...</Dialog>
          <Dialog>'A Ghost Story:
The Cat's Stare'...</Dialog>
          <Dialog>So we're starting...</Dialog>
          <Dialog>It was a Western mansion,
built in the Taisho era.
For generations, its owners
all met with grisly deaths--</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Now no one lives there or
even visits. It just sits
abandoned on the edge of town...</Dialog>
          <Dialog>In the mansion, there were
stairs to the basement.
And as you walk down them,
one step at a time...</Dialog>
          <Dialog>A cat's... there...</Dialog>
          <Dialog>On the stairs,
a cat's... there...</Dialog>
          <Dialog>MEOOOOW!!!!</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Whoa!？
You scared me...</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Heh heh heh...</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Hff!</Dialog>
          <Dialog>You're up next.</Dialog>
          <Dialog>All right.
Then... let's see.
Once upon a time...</Dialog>
          <Dialog>And when the kid
slowly turned around...</Dialog>
          <Dialog>...Y-Yeah.</Dialog>
          <Dialog>IT WAS YOUUUUU!!!!</Dialog>
          <Dialog>AAAAAH!!!!</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Hahaha!</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Idiot!
You idiooot!!
What was that？ That's cheating!</Dialog>
          <Dialog>All right, I'm blowing out
the last candle, okay？</Dialog>
          <Dialog>(Blow on the candle
to put out the flame.)</Dialog>
          <Dialog>(It's pitch black now...)</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Hey...
Did you just hear something？</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Who knows...
Maybe something came over？
From the other side...</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Nooo!
I can't take this anymore!!</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Waah！</Dialog>
          <Dialog>▲小早川＊▲, sorry, sorry!
I was just kidding.</Dialog>
          <Dialog>No way.
Take responsibility.</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Responsibility...？</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Hold me tight,
just like this.</Dialog>
          <Dialog>▲小早川＊▲……。</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Rinko was really,
really scared...
Stay like this till morning...</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Got it...
▲小早川＊▲!!</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Owowow...!!</Dialog>
          <Dialog>A dream, huh...
That was pretty elaborate...</Dialog>
          <Dialog>…………。</Dialog>
          <Dialog>(Haha, look at her
sleeping so innocently...)</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Ow!</Dialog>
          <Dialog>(Back to sleep, then...)</Dialog>
          <Dialog>I'm not even asleep!</Dialog>
          <Dialog>You okay？
You were groaning in your sleep.</Dialog>
        </Dialogs>
      </SDL2>
