        <Dialogs>
          <Dialog>○○○○○○○○</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Aaah!
That was a great soak!</Dialog>
          <Dialog>(Looks like ▲小早川＊▲...
still isn't out yet？)</Dialog>
          <Dialog>(She's taking pretty long...
Did she already go back to
the room？)</Dialog>
          <Dialog>I'm back.
▲小早川＊▲, you in here？</Dialog>
          <Dialog>(Hm？
Is someone in our room's
open-air bath？)</Dialog>
          <Dialog>▲小早川＊▲？</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Kobayakawa</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Hmm？
What is it？</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Oh, there you are. I thought
you weren't gonna use this bath.</Dialog>
          <Dialog>I can't hear you!
Why don't you open the door？</Dialog>
          <Dialog>(Is it really okay...？
Well, she did tell me
to open it...)</Dialog>
          <Dialog>(▲小早川＊▲!!!?
W-Whoa, sorry!)</Dialog>
          <Dialog>It's fine.
The Rinko in here is a sweet,
honest little Rinko, after all.</Dialog>
          <Dialog>I-Is that how it works？</Dialog>
          <Dialog>That's how it works.
Come on, take a close look.
Different from usual, right？</Dialog>
          <Dialog>(Take a close look, she says...
Either way, I can't really
see much...)</Dialog>
          <Dialog>(Right, if I just look
a little more from the side...)</Dialog>
          <Dialog>(Hmm, why is that？
Oh, right, the steam!
The steam's in the way!)</Dialog>
          <Dialog>(At times like this...
Right, I just have to blow on it!)</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Alright, just a little more!</Dialog>
          <Dialog>No way...
Hey, what are you peeking for!?</Dialog>
          <Dialog>...Huh？
No, wait, you told me to look—</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Teacher!
Some pervy boy is
peeking in the bath!</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Hold on a second!
I'm being framed!!</Dialog>
        </Dialogs>
